>>__ load "simpLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `add_safe_solver`

``` hol4
simpLib.add_safe_solver : Traverse.ssolver ->
  simpLib.simpset -> simpLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Adds a safe solver to a simpset.

Safe solvers are the final solvers of `simpLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe =
true}`. They are not used for the side conditions of conditional rewrites.
The solver is added after the existing safe solvers, unless one with the
same name is already present, in which case the simpset is unchanged. See
`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver` for the solver type.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val decide : Traverse.ssolver = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE};
>>_ val ss = simpLib.add_safe_solver decide
     boolSimps.bool_ss;
>> simpLib.GEN_SIMP_TAC {safe = true} ss [] ([], “x < x + 1”)
     (Context.snapshot());
```

